<h1>DevLife Log: How Long Have You Been Coding?</h1>
<p class="answer">We have been studying Systems Engineering for several semesters, and we have been building <b>SICUA</b>.</p>
<p class="meta">My Dev Journey – SICUA<br>Sarly Samira Naranjo Tello and Emmanuel Paz Cabezas · Professor Segundo Félix Quiñones Angulo</p>
